     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">大课间活动调整通知（附：要求与路线）</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">根据季节变化，于<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日开始大课间活动方式将调整为跑操。各班按照课间操进场路线进场。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">一、活动要求：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">、下课铃响后班级组织学生排队出教室，按规定路线下楼后<SPAN style="COLOR: black">二路纵队慢跑到达操场</SPAN>按指定位置集队（集合时间为<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="COLOR: red" lang=EN-US><FONT color=#000000>6</FONT></SPAN></B>分钟）。集队要求各班四路或八路纵队。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">、<SPAN style="COLOR: black">进场、退场都按规定路线二路慢跑，</SPAN>教师、指定学生对全程情况进行评价。根据要求跑操结束前在指定场地<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">原地踏步</B>，过程评价当天由德育处公布。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">、班主任原则上到场管理并督促锻炼，德育处、体育教师和各班班长负责年级组织和巡回指导评价。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">、各班应加强活动的安全教育，牢固树立“安全意识”，尤其是下楼时一定要注意安全，防止拥挤事件的发生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>5</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">、碰到下雨等天气特殊情况，统一暂停活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">、所有</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">请假的学生在升旗台前集中，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">以班级为单位一路纵队。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">二、跑操线路<SPAN style="COLOR: black">（各班间隔距离）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">各年级安排如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">高一年级集合地点：每班级成四路纵队，两名同学作为领跑并佩带班级带。（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）班升旗台南侧靠围网，面向南；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）班在（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）班前面；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）班<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>号门靠南；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）班在（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）班前面；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）班在<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>号篮球场靠北柱子边，面向东；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）班在<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>号篮球场靠北柱子边；<SPAN style="COLOR: black">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>）班过道东，面向北；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>）班形体房西侧过道，面向北</SPAN>；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>）班在（<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>）班前面；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>）班在器材室西侧过道，面向北；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>）班在一楼办公室西侧过道，面向北；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>）班在一楼厕所西侧过道，面向北；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>13</SPAN>）班在实验楼前过道，面向北；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN>）班在实验楼前过道，面向北；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>）班在<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>号门之间近围网，面向南；（<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>班）在升旗台北侧靠围网，面向南。沿篮球四边及过道逆时针方向跑进。（详见图）</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201610/2016101215154597.jpg" target=_blank><IMG style="WIDTH: 661px; HEIGHT: 240px" onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201610/2016101215154597.jpg" width=691 onload=resizepic(this) height=271> </A></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
