<TABLE cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width="100%">
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD style="BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; BORDER-RIGHT: #d4d0c8">
<DIV>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">升旗台</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></DIV></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></v:textbox></v:rect></v:group></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt"></SPAN> </P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">高三年级集合地点：<SPAN style="COLOR: black">每班级成八路纵队，</SPAN>两名同学作为领跑并佩带班级带。（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）在田径场终点线开始，面向南；顺时针方向依次为（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>）班。以逆时针方向慢跑<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>圈。（详见图）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">高二年级集合地点：每班级成八路纵队，两名同学作为领跑并佩带班级带。<SPAN style="COLOR: black">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>）班在高三（<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>）班后面，面向北；</SPAN>顺时针方向依次为（<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）班排列。以逆时针方向慢跑<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>—<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>圈。（详见图）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">高二、高三田径场地站位图：<SPAN style="COLOR: black">（每班级<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>米距离）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><v:group style="Z-INDEX: 2; POSITION: absolute; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 21.9pt; WIDTH: 381pt; HEIGHT: 140.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.85pt; LEFT: 0px" id=_x0000_s1054 coordsize="7620,2808" coordorigin="2151,3786"><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t135 coordsize="21600,21600" path="m10800,qx21600,10800,10800,21600l,21600,,xe" o:spt="135"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:path textboxrect="0,3163,18437,18437" o:connecttype="rect" gradientshapeok="t"></v:path></v:shapetype><v:shape style="POSITION: absolute; WIDTH: 3615px; HEIGHT: 2808px; TOP: 3786px; LEFT: 5886px" id=_x0000_s1055 type="#_x0000_t135"></v:shape><v:shape style="POSITION: absolute; WIDTH: 3630px; HEIGHT: 2808px; TOP: 3786px; LEFT: 2256px; flip: x" id=_x0000_s1056 type="#_x0000_t135"></v:shape><v:line style="POSITION: absolute" id=_x0000_s1057 to="2256,6077" from="2151,4829"><v:stroke endarrow="block"></v:stroke></v:line><v:line style="POSITION: absolute; flip: x y" id=_x0000_s1058 to="9771,5658" from="9351,4254"><v:stroke endarrow="block"></v:stroke></v:line></v:group></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201610/2016101215160602.jpg" target=_blank><IMG style="WIDTH: 584px; HEIGHT: 229px" onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201610/2016101215160602.jpg" width=613 onload=resizepic(this) height=249> </A></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 324pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 27.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 324pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 27.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">德育处、体育组<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 318pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 26.5" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>日</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 318pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 26.5" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt"></SPAN> </P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5 face="Times New Roman"><STRONG>附：跑操评分标准：</STRONG></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、进场队伍无序或路上不慢跑</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：进场队伍无序，不慢跑扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分；</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、进场和行进中是否正确佩戴绶带</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：绶带拿在手上或没有绶带扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分；</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、进场按时、人数齐全</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：进场不按时扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，有假条的同学不能超过</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">人，请假扣每人</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">0.5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分、超过部分每人次扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，无故缺席每人扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分扣完为止。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、队列队形（前后左右均成一排）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">20</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：队形散乱，横纵均不成排扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，若有几个同学脱离队伍，导致班级队形乱，则</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分全部扣完。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、行进中安静、无交头接耳说话声</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：行进中要保证认真严肃，若有同学交头接耳说话声则每人次扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，扣完为止。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、中途停顿</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">20</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：跑步中精神饱满不拖沓，要求抬头、挺胸、收腹、提臀。慢跑中途若有停顿，停顿一次扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，扣完为止。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、精神饱满（抬头、挺胸、收腹、提臀、手势）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：走时手半握拳，手臂伸直前后摆动：跑时两臂提于腰间前后摆动，两手半握拳（拳眼向上），前不露肘后不露手。对于班级小部分同学做得较差的扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，对于大部分做得较差的扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、有无提前退场</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：班级有部分同学提前退场的扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分，整班同学提前退场，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分全部扣完。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 318pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 26.5" class=MsoNormal></SPAN> </P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
